    This layer implements the operation as described in
    the paper `Group Normalization <https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.08494>`__

    .. math::
        y = \frac{x - \mathrm{E}[x]}{ \sqrt{\mathrm{Var}[x] + \epsilon}} * \gamma + \beta

